	SS 5:
	\L_077b6:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　Rance’s Bedroom'
	\L_078a3:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance was writing something'
	R
	'when Sill appeared.'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'Good morning.'
	R
	'Why are you up so early,'
	R
	'Master Rance?'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077b6:
	ZH 1:
	'The clock said it was 5.'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh, you’re here.'
	R
	'I haven’t taken care of my'
	R
	'business yet. Sit there and'
	R
	'wait.'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077b6:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance pointed to the chair'
	R
	'next to him with his pen.'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, Master Rance.'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077b6:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill sat in the chair and'
	R
	'obediently waited as she was'
	R
	'told.'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'Um... Master Rance.'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm?'
	R
	'What?'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s going to happen now?'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'To what?'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'The world...'
	R
	'I heard from Ms. Maris...'
	\L_078a3:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum’s forces caused'
	R
	'devastation everywhere, so...'
	R
	'Everything’s in a pretty bad'
	R
	'state...'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'Well...'
	R
	'The continent did suffer a lot'
	R
	'of damage...'
	\L_078a3:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s probably impossible for'
	R
	'Leazas to keep the world under'
	R
	'control.'
	\L_078a3:
	ZH 1:
	'There’ll be rebellions'
	R
	'eventually, and we’ll return'
	R
	'to a world of war, most'
	R
	'likely...'
	\L_078a3:
	ZH 1:
	'Even if Warg doesn’t keep up'
	R
	'making it dream, this world’ll'
	R
	'probably turn into what that'
	R
	'stupid whale wants...'
	\L_078a3:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, finished writing.'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077b6:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance put the letter he worked'
	R
	'so hard to write in an'
	R
	'envelope.'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'Um... What were you writing?'
	R
	'If it was too much trouble, I'
	R
	'could have done it for you...'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah...'
	R
	'It’s a divorce statement.'
	R
	'I’m giving it to Lia later.'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'...Huh...?'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m tired of being a king.'
	R
	'I was planning on going on'
	R
	'another adventure. So that'
	R
	'status’ll just get in the way.'
	\L_078a3:
	ZH 1:
	'Also, I accomplished my'
	R
	'initial goal anyway...'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'Your initial goal...??'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'N-Nothing.'
	R
	'Forget about it.'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... Okay, Master Rance...'
	\L_078a3:
	ZH 1:
	'...Um... Master Rance...'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'If you’re going on an'
	R
	'adventure... I’d like to...'
	R
	'um... go with...'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course you’re going with me.'
	\L_078a3:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	R
	'You’re my slave. Were you'
	R
	'planning on making your master'
	R
	'go on an adventure alone?'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah...'
	\L_078a3:
	ZH 1:
	'No!!'
	R
	'I would go anywhere with you,'
	R
	'Master Rance!'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm, that’s my slave.'
	R
	'Gahahahahahaha.'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'But...'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'Can we not be thieves'
	R
	'again...?'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077b6:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜conk）'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_077ee:
	ZH 1:
	'Th-That hurt, Master Rance...'
	\L_078a3:
	\L_07896:
	\L_0777e:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s what you get for'
	R
	'speaking out of turn.'
	R
	'Man...'
